# FINAL OPERATING PRINCIPLE

The objective is not merely to build an application.

The objective is to build a professional software project that:

- Can be understood by another developer.
- Can be continued by another AI agent.
- Preserves its technical history.
- Explains why architectural decisions were made.
- Records alternatives and trade-offs.
- Has verifiable tests.
- Has reliable documentation.
- Can be maintained over several years.
- Does not depend on one AI conversation or one particular AI model.

**Build the development infrastructure first. Establish knowledge continuity. Verify everything. Obtain approval. Only then begin building the application.**